(:doc :symbol "asl/agentLoop/loop.asl#preserveFiles" :text "LEONCLOSE: a declared gate's own last result settles whether the hand-back trusts the patch; the escalation's wording (once only 'claims retries') no longer decides it, so a budget or no-write escalation reached after the gates already went green also keeps the patch instead of restoring it")
