(:doc :symbol "asl/agentLoop/main.asl#" :text "Leon's CLI entry, ported from scripts/agentLoop/main.py: one (:agent ...) form in, one receipt line and an exit code out. parseInvocation reads the form into main.py's params dict, values as j/Json so str(), int() and truthiness follow Python; main validates in main.py's order, answers :resume without :answer from the journal (resumeReport), re-enters a journalled session with :answer (journalResume), and builds the dry-run receipt with journal/buildSystemPrompt. The live path runs the self-hosted runLoopWithProvider! turn loop and journals gates, retries, hand-back and final status. repoRoot is the checkout holding scripts/agentLoop/effects.asn and asl/grammar (Python's _REPO_ROOT), rootDir the workspace (ASL_ROOT_DIR). Where main.py crashes on a journal line without :task or :status, journalResume answers ERR_JOURNAL_READ; ~user in :root stays unexpanded.")
