(:doc :symbol "asl/agentLoop/txn.asl#" :text "U2: the Leon agent loop's txn op and its aids from scripts/agentLoop/loop.py on asl-host: execTxn! (_exec_txn_op) = txnPrepare (owns, root and effect checks, the (:txn ...) form sent to asl) then txnFinish! (the receipt, with the abort aid, balance aid and raw-write hint on a refusal); balanceAid (_compute_balance_aid), txnRefusal (_txn_refusal), abortAid! and abortAidOn (_compute_abort_aid), intelSubop (intel_subop), widenToSymbol! with widenWanted and widenPick (widen_to_symbol), insideRoot (inside_root, _is_path_in_repo), parseEffects, loadEffects! and checkEffect (_load_effects, check_effect). The asl transport, the journal snapshot and receipt ids are parameters (run, snap, newId) owned by other units. Strings are bytes; columns, cuts and tails count code points. Known divergences: files are read as bytes, so invalid UTF-8 is not replaced by U+FFFD; regex \\s and strip() whitespace are ASCII plus 0x1c-0x1f; an integer :file or :content is taken as its digits.")
